                    "level": {
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "Dwarven heroes of old could shrug off their enemies' magic, and some of that resistance manifests in you. You gain the Call on Ancient Blood reaction.\n\n**Call on Ancient Blood**\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Trigger:** You attempt a saving throw against a magical effect, but you haven't rolled yet.\n\nYour ancestors' innate resistance to magic surges, before slowly ebbing down. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus until the end of this turn. This bonus also applies to the triggering save."
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
